# Smuggler's Copter: "If you do, discard a card" depends on a card actually being drawn (CR 608.2c). Bot1's library holds
# one card, drawn in its turn-3 draw step, so when the crewed Copter attacks and Bot1 accepts the loot the library is empty:
# nothing is drawn, so nothing is discarded (the hand is untouched), and Bot1, having tried to draw from an empty library,
# loses the game (CR 704.5b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Llanowar Elves
Smuggler's Copter
Forest
Forest
Forest

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Activate(Ability: Crew)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Smuggler's Copter)
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
